1. Language Specification:
   BULT is authored targeting the C> (C-Greater) Systems Programming Language
   specification maintained by black-210:
   https://github.com/black-210/C-

2. Target Repository:
   https://github.com/black-210/BULT

3. Scientific & Algorithmic Foundations:
   - RF Signal Processing & Discrete Fourier Transform: Cooley-Tukey Radix-2 FFT,
     Welch PSD estimation, Windowing (Hann, Hamming, Blackman).
   - RF-DNA Fingerprinting: Statistical feature extraction over instantaneous
     amplitude, phase trajectory, and spectral moments.
   - Direction-Finding: Stansfield / least-squares multi-station triangulation
     and Time-Difference-of-Arrival (TDoA) hyperbolic localization solvers.
   - IUPAC Standard Atomic Weights (2021/2026) for molecular mass computations.
   - Electromagnetic propagation: Free-Space Path Loss (FSPL) and Friis equations.
